			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 730161501,
					"content": "呼…真的嚇到了，幸好有蘭百梨迦幫忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161502,
					"content": "早說過，派蒙大意，會吃大虧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161503,
					"content": "唔…我知道錯啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161504,
					"content": "遺蹟裡有守衛，那就一定是會動的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161505
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730161505,
					"content": "說的也是，這就叫「名副其實」嗎？畢竟對它們來說，我們才是外來者呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161506,
					"content": "#那菈{NICKNAME}和派蒙是桓那的外來者，蘭百梨迦不是，所以是大大鐵塊不懂道理。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161507,
					"content": "大大鐵塊不懂道理，蘭百梨迦就讓它懂道理。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161508,
					"content": "嗚…派蒙會當懂道理的好孩子的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161509,
					"content": "派蒙要說話算話喔。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161510
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730161510,
					"content": "那當然啦！明天…不，現在就開始！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161511,
					"content": "#這裡的石頭，只有蘭那羅才能喚醒它。那菈{NICKNAME}和派蒙，之後就交給蘭百梨迦了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161512,
					"content": "喔！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161513,
					"content": "這樣離治好法留納神機又近了一步呢！等治好了法留納神機，水天叢林就不會再飄著那麼多孢子了吧…想起來都鼻子癢癢的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161514,
					"content": "法留納神機會淨化雨水，不會再有黑色的雨，也不會再有這麼多「孢子」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161515,
					"content": "不過蘑菇…應該還是會有。派蒙要小心，不要像蘭那庫拉一樣，差點被蘑菇吞掉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161516,
					"content": "嗯…我會小心的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161517,
					"content": "#這裡已經不需要蘭百梨迦了，我會回「歇腳處」找蘭般度。那菈{NICKNAME}和派蒙，要不要一起回去？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161518,
						730161520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161518,
					"content": "那我們一起走吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161519
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730161519,
					"content": "嗯。桓那危險，一起走安全。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161520,
					"content": "還有其他事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161521
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730161521,
					"content": "#那菈{NICKNAME}和派蒙要小心，不要大意。蘭穆護昆達看顧你們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭百梨迦"
				}
			]
